+/*
+ * Where Is Marker, on whatever key the player gives it in Key Binds: the
+ * same as N - where the marker is, then turned toward the way to it.
+ * 1.4.4.4 took the command away with Keypad dot's default bind, and the
+ * tester, who had put it on N themselves, was left with a key that did
+ * nothing while the marker's beep kept saying they faced the wrong way.
+ * The command stays, so a key set to it keeps working.
+ */
+static void CG_AccessibilityMarkerWhere_f(void)
+{
+	ETA_HudNarrator_HoldPassive(cg.time);
+	ETA_MarkerWhereAndFace();
